    },
    {
      "fact": "The calendar covers 190 pupil days and makes no provision for the 5 extra non-contact days for teachers, so INSET days should be arranged outside the term dates or outside pupil hours.",
      "source": "https://www.cumberland.gov.uk/sites/default/files/2025-04/2026-27_cumberland_school_term_holiday_dates_.pdf"
    },
    {
      "fact": "For 2026-27 the council suggests Tuesday 1 September 2026 and Monday 4 January 2027 as INSET days, plus three others to be locally determined.",
      "source": "https://www.cumberland.gov.uk/sites/default/files/2025-04/2026-27_cumberland_school_term_holiday_dates_.pdf"
    },
    {
      "fact": "For 2027-28 the suggested INSET days are Thursday 2 and Friday 3 September 2027 and Tuesday 4 January 2028, plus two others to be locally determined.",
      "source": "https://www.cumberland.gov.uk/sites/default/files/2025-04/2027-28_cumberland_school_term_holiday_dates_.pdf"
    },
    {
      "fact": "The 2026-27 year ends early, on Friday 16 July 2027, and the 2027-28 year starts on Monday 6 September 2027.",
      "source": "https://www.cumberland.gov.uk/schools-and-education/school-term-and-holiday-dates"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Cumberland already publishes dates for 2028-29, starting on Wednesday 6 September 2028.",
